                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>For the duration of this encounter, Mullun has the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 1} condition, but unlike the Orthux guards, his frightened condition reduces normally once combat begins; his stats have not been adjusted to take this condition into account.</p>"
