        {
            "_id": "2lUxH1V1gZTGIWkO",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
            "name": "Flea Infested",
            "sort": 700000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "passive"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>A character who successfully Strikes Mullun with an unarmed weapon or a Light weapon, or who is Grabbed or Shoved by Mullun, must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|dc:14] save or become infested with fleas.</p><hr /><p><strong>Fleas</strong> (disease)</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:14]</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> infested but suffering no obvious effects (1 hour)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 1} (1 hour)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 2} and can't reduce its sickened value below 1 (1 day)</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
